  * closure report + JSON + security review + A5 reconciliation;
  * G02_HTTP_APPROVAL_EXPIRY renewed 2026-11-19 -> 2027-02-17 (root
    cause of the 62 inherited full-suite failures — single stale
    constant the D2 renewal pass missed);
  * honesty-gate durable path follows the latest mission window;
  * frozen manifest re-pin g02_contract.py + corrected drift set;
  * D5 scanner regen (108 findings; dead-code ratchet 149<=149 PASS);
  * UM-DR-43 Workstream A: ApplicationModel.apply_observation —
    incremental single-observation merge, provenance-exact (observed vs
    inferred), abstain-with-reason, canonical IDs merging with the
    full-rebuild path (tests 6/6; existing appmodel suites 29 passed).
